WEBVTT

00:04.050 --> 00:06.030
As the chaos of war started to subside

00:06.430 --> 00:08.570
and the world approached a time of peace,

00:09.030 --> 00:13.800
the authorities tried to suppress those of us 
who were training to become Honki People.

00:15.420 --> 00:17.520
Let's go, let's go, let's go, 
let's go, let's go, let's go,

00:17.520 --> 00:19.120
let's go!

00:19.730 --> 00:23.050
Let's go! Let's go! Let's go! Let's go! 
Let's go! Let's go! Let's go! Let's go!

00:30.100 --> 00:33.530
I guess I'm still no match for you, Ichiya.

00:34.560 --> 00:37.520
How long do you intend to mock me like this?

00:38.020 --> 00:39.020
Huh?

00:43.630 --> 00:45.320
Have you lost your mind, Ichiya?

00:45.320 --> 00:48.530
If we have a serious fight, 
one of us will die!

00:49.060 --> 00:51.670
I have long been prepared for this.

00:51.670 --> 00:54.740
At this point, nothing else remains for me.

00:55.120 --> 00:58.040
What does that mean? 
At least explain yourself!

00:58.360 --> 01:00.410
This is a waste of breath!

01:21.220 --> 01:22.340
Come,

01:22.960 --> 01:24.900
Senya!

01:27.260 --> 01:28.360
Let's go!

01:36.220 --> 01:37.790
Even now,

01:38.790 --> 01:42.280
must you still insist on mocking me?

01:43.380 --> 01:45.460
Ichi... ya...

01:45.760 --> 01:47.040
Stand.

01:47.430 --> 01:49.760
Stand, Senya!

01:59.980 --> 02:03.560
I will keep this grudge, Senya.

02:04.650 --> 02:05.770
Ichiya!

02:16.480 --> 02:19.620
Ichi... ya...

02:29.160 --> 02:33.010
So I gotta settle things with Ichiya.

02:33.900 --> 02:38.260
I need to understand why he risked his life.

02:39.540 --> 02:42.850
And to do that, you intended 
to trick me and then kill me.

02:42.850 --> 02:44.410
No!

02:44.930 --> 02:47.400
I intended to return your 
body to you afterward.

02:47.400 --> 02:49.750
I don't want to hear your excuses!

02:50.750 --> 02:52.530
Get out of me.

02:54.250 --> 02:56.470
I'm sorry I kept it from you.

02:57.190 --> 03:01.580
I really had fun spending 
time with you, man.

04:42.180 --> 04:46.140
<b>#11   Unanswered Wishes! Sudden Crab Fried Rice</b>

04:52.250 --> 04:54.800
S-Spare me!

05:06.740 --> 05:07.900
Matakara.

05:08.330 --> 05:12.260
That Ichiya thing possessing you intends 
to take over your body completely.

05:12.260 --> 05:13.630
You have to force him out!

05:14.450 --> 05:15.930
Why do you care now?

05:16.610 --> 05:17.780
Oh, I get it.

05:18.220 --> 05:20.900
You don't like the idea 
of me getting stronger.

05:21.760 --> 05:24.890
If he takes control of your body,
 you might die!

05:25.240 --> 05:26.290
Fine by me.

05:27.430 --> 05:29.390
As long as I can beat you.

05:38.040 --> 05:40.160
What am I supposed to do?

05:41.000 --> 05:44.610
Why won't you fight Arajin? 
By now you should be ab—

05:44.610 --> 05:45.630
Shut up.

05:46.890 --> 05:49.120
I have something else to do first.

05:51.190 --> 05:54.200
What's gonna happen to us now?

05:54.200 --> 05:58.490
With Marito-kun taken out like that, 
Siguma might be done for.

05:59.820 --> 06:03.460
Shut the hell up! And you're okay with that?

06:03.460 --> 06:05.270
How could I be?!

06:05.940 --> 06:07.220
How could I?

06:08.090 --> 06:09.190
But still...

06:23.600 --> 06:25.240
Welcome in!

06:25.530 --> 06:27.580
Same again today?

06:28.180 --> 06:29.400
Jasmine-chan, please.

06:29.400 --> 06:32.250
All right, one special 
serving of Jasmine-chan!

06:33.510 --> 06:35.460
I can't take any more of this.

06:36.050 --> 06:40.550
Whenever I imagine you with another man, 
I feel like I'm about to lose my mind.

06:40.910 --> 06:42.710
I want you all to myself!

06:43.550 --> 06:46.760
It's just you and me. Forever. Okay?

06:49.110 --> 06:50.370
Excuse us.

06:52.820 --> 06:56.520
Um, what's gonna happen to us now?

06:59.090 --> 07:00.520
Is Siguma really gonna...

07:04.140 --> 07:06.300
Siguma isn't done for yet.

07:07.860 --> 07:11.150
What the hell is wrong with Matakara, anyway?

07:11.150 --> 07:13.500
He ain't doing things the Minato way.

07:14.000 --> 07:16.920
How does Ken-san plan to handle it?

07:17.230 --> 07:18.650
I dunno.

07:20.240 --> 07:21.750
Hey, is that...

07:29.940 --> 07:31.160
Matakara!

07:31.510 --> 07:33.390
<b>Mi</b>

07:33.770 --> 07:35.440
What are you doing?

07:35.440 --> 07:38.810
Ken-san. I want to fight you one-on-one.

07:39.650 --> 07:41.970
Are you out of your mind?!

07:41.970 --> 07:45.440
Hey, Matakara! What are you doing?

07:48.530 --> 07:50.840
Damn it! Cut this shit out, man!

07:53.340 --> 07:54.490
Ken-san.

07:55.290 --> 07:58.920
Tomorrow. Hour of the cock. Ichizu Bay.

08:06.150 --> 08:07.610
Matakara...

08:08.630 --> 08:10.640
<b>Chu~ Chu~ Chinese Restaurant
Open for Business</b>

08:09.160 --> 08:13.140
Hey, you hear? Doman's gonna fight tomorrow!

08:13.140 --> 08:17.990
Yeah. And with that guy Matakara, 
who's in Minato with him!

08:19.360 --> 08:20.460
Fine by me.

08:21.560 --> 08:23.520
As long as I can beat you.

08:24.280 --> 08:26.210
Here's your fried rice.

08:27.660 --> 08:30.660
Um, this isn't what we ordered.

08:34.130 --> 08:35.290
That's good!

08:36.280 --> 08:38.660
Hi there! Did you get even taller?

08:39.350 --> 08:42.170
Oh, my! What a growth spurt!

08:42.770 --> 08:43.770
Uh...

08:48.860 --> 08:50.180
Um,

08:50.950 --> 08:53.180
did you want to talk to me?

09:03.900 --> 09:04.990
He conscious?

09:09.550 --> 09:12.200
I'll take over. You need a break.

09:12.550 --> 09:14.310
I don't want you collapsing, too.

09:18.160 --> 09:19.310
I'll come back later.

09:22.640 --> 09:26.540
Big Brother... please wake up!

09:40.270 --> 09:43.040
Less than an hour until the fight.

09:43.040 --> 09:45.850
Aw, man! What am I gonna do?

09:45.850 --> 09:48.860
Why is this happening, anyway?

09:48.860 --> 09:50.830
<i>It's just like before.</i>

09:50.860 --> 09:55.200
<b>Minato</b>

09:53.360 --> 09:55.200
Doman Kenichiro!

09:56.240 --> 09:59.420
I get to join Minato when he's the head?

09:59.420 --> 10:01.610
This is a dream come true!

10:01.610 --> 10:06.210
Yeah, no kidding! A 300-fight 
winning streak is insane, right?

10:06.780 --> 10:08.060
Who the hell are you?

10:08.370 --> 10:10.800
Oh, me? Komao!

10:10.800 --> 10:11.860
Nice to meet you.

10:11.860 --> 10:13.230
The hell is your problem?!

10:17.580 --> 10:18.970
What's up with that guy?

10:21.380 --> 10:25.230
Doman Kenichiro! Face me one-on-one!

10:25.230 --> 10:26.720
Huh?!

10:31.060 --> 10:33.490
That guy's gonna get killed.

10:46.370 --> 10:47.270
Wha...

10:48.840 --> 10:50.840
Grit your teeth!

11:12.400 --> 11:13.190
It's yours.

11:14.270 --> 11:16.200
I bought it by accident.

11:16.200 --> 11:18.260
My pal thought you were awesome!

11:18.260 --> 11:21.950
"That guy must have some balls, 
to take Ken-san on!" Right?

11:22.280 --> 11:24.880
Huh? I never said that!

11:24.880 --> 11:27.680
Huh? Or was it, "I wish I was that tall"?

11:27.680 --> 11:28.940
Hell no!

11:33.540 --> 11:34.720
Thanks.

11:45.660 --> 11:48.330
Koma. Go get Arajin.

11:48.330 --> 11:51.160
But Ara-pyon isn't at school today.

11:51.160 --> 11:53.560
Yeah, so I'm telling you to go get him.

11:53.560 --> 11:55.100
Before the fight starts.

11:55.100 --> 11:56.490
Huh? Why?

11:57.900 --> 12:00.740
He's Matakara's buddy, right?

12:03.660 --> 12:05.000
Right!

12:05.360 --> 12:08.500
Roger dodger! Leave it to me!

12:14.020 --> 12:15.960
How is Marito-kun?

12:15.960 --> 12:18.110
He still hasn't woken up.

12:19.160 --> 12:21.990
It's been three days, hasn't it?

12:25.690 --> 12:27.340
Ryu-chan, where are you going?

12:27.340 --> 12:28.890
I'm going after Matakara again.

12:28.890 --> 12:31.400
Huh? Wh-What are you talking about?

12:31.710 --> 12:33.340
Wait a minute!

12:33.340 --> 12:35.820
I can't just stand around doing nothing!

12:35.820 --> 12:38.280
I'm gonna go avenge Marito-ku—

12:38.280 --> 12:39.110
Dummy!

12:41.110 --> 12:43.680
Look at the shape you're in!

12:43.680 --> 12:45.600
Everyone here is just as mad as you are!

12:45.600 --> 12:48.100
You can't take care of this by yourself!

12:48.100 --> 12:51.210
Especially when Siguma 
is in so much trouble...

12:51.210 --> 12:55.360
You're such a... dummy-dummy blockhead!

12:57.210 --> 12:57.980
Ow!

13:00.470 --> 13:03.720
Jabashiri, Hagure... Thanks, guys.

13:04.380 --> 13:08.480
Until Marito comes back to us, 
we've got to protect Siguma.

13:09.850 --> 13:10.930
Yeah!

13:09.850 --> 13:10.930
Yes!

13:11.480 --> 13:13.480
<b>Mi</b>

13:13.480 --> 13:16.480
<b>Minato Kai</b>

13:18.190 --> 13:20.740
<b>Minato Kai</b>

13:37.260 --> 13:39.220
I'm not letting you pass.

13:43.550 --> 13:46.140
Why have you gone back to the way you were?

13:50.160 --> 13:54.230
If you go and fight Ken-san like this, 
you won't be able to come back to us!

13:54.700 --> 13:56.980
So I'm going to stop you!

14:06.280 --> 14:07.950
Why are you doing this?

14:08.730 --> 14:10.160
Answer me, damn it!

14:24.540 --> 14:28.420
Have you... forgotten everything?

14:35.100 --> 14:38.620
You gotta remember, man.

14:39.250 --> 14:42.540
You've gotta come back,

14:43.230 --> 14:44.860
Matakara!

14:51.420 --> 14:53.190
I'm not letting you pass.

14:54.540 --> 14:56.360
No way.

14:57.270 --> 14:59.460
I'm not letting you.

15:20.150 --> 15:26.200
You're still my... buddy, man.

16:01.430 --> 16:04.110
Arajin! Your friend is here!

16:04.110 --> 16:05.150
Friend?

16:05.150 --> 16:06.900
Ara-pyon!

16:07.400 --> 16:08.800
Komao... san?

16:08.800 --> 16:10.130
Come on, let's go!

16:10.130 --> 16:10.910
Go where?

16:10.910 --> 16:14.160
To see Ken-san and Matakara's 
fight! Where else?

16:14.160 --> 16:17.180
C'mon, hurry up! It's about to start!

16:17.180 --> 16:18.630
I'm not going!

16:18.630 --> 16:21.670
What reason would I... have to go?

16:22.120 --> 16:24.380
'Cause Matakara is your pal, right?

16:37.510 --> 16:42.400
If you lose here, I'll never forgive you! 
I'll be the one to defeat you!

16:50.030 --> 16:53.670
I will defeat you and become stronger.

16:57.160 --> 16:58.410
We made it!

16:58.410 --> 17:00.420
Huh? Where's Zabu?

17:09.300 --> 17:12.860
Matakara's parents abandoned him.

17:13.540 --> 17:18.930
The person who raised him 
was his brother Mitsukuni.

17:20.940 --> 17:29.330
But then, for protecting a friend, 
Mitsukuni was sent to juvie.

17:29.900 --> 17:34.130
When Matakara lost the brother 
who was his only support,

17:34.570 --> 17:37.700
he also lost sight of himself.

17:44.930 --> 17:47.050
Why isn't he making a move?

17:47.050 --> 17:48.500
Shut up and watch!

17:48.820 --> 17:50.870
There's no way Ken-san's gonna lose.

17:54.550 --> 17:56.060
<i>I got one!</i>

18:29.420 --> 18:31.590
Grit your teeth!

18:33.570 --> 18:39.600
<i>I'm not the person I was before.</i>

18:40.850 --> 18:44.850
<i>I'm going to beat you and become stronger!</i>

18:48.280 --> 18:52.590
Give me... power.

18:54.770 --> 18:56.740
Bucchigiri.

19:37.340 --> 19:38.820
Go down!

19:39.950 --> 19:42.410
Go down, go down, go down, go down,

19:42.410 --> 19:45.580
go down, go down, go down, go down!

19:46.000 --> 19:49.670
Go down! Go down!

19:50.510 --> 19:51.600
Kenichiro...

19:52.100 --> 19:55.780
If anything happens to me, 
take care of Matakara.

20:46.980 --> 20:52.480
<b><i>Chu Chu Chinese Restaurant</i></b>

20:47.550 --> 20:52.480
If it comes to that, you'll have 
to stop Matakara yourself.

20:53.700 --> 20:56.110
I don't know if I can.

20:59.740 --> 21:01.050
Yes, you can.

21:02.350 --> 21:04.460
With this fist of yours.

21:14.100 --> 21:18.260
Now I can fight Ara-chan.

21:23.010 --> 21:25.070
The time hath come

21:25.540 --> 21:28.520
for me to face Senya again!

21:57.430 --> 22:00.630
I am Senya, the Majin.

22:00.630 --> 22:03.430
Now, tell me your wish!

22:07.920 --> 22:09.040
Senya.

22:11.310 --> 22:12.980
Let's merge.

23:44.990 --> 23:50.440
<b>Fateful Duel!</b>

23:44.990 --> 23:50.440
<b>Beyond the Gyoza Dumplings</b>

23:45.420 --> 23:47.940
Bucchigi-you again next week!
